{"id":"en_the-young-master-s-forbidden-butler","title":"The Young Master's Forbidden Butler","titleEn":"The Young Master's Forbidden Butler","description":"Driven by a burning desire to avenge his parents' deaths, Simon takes a position as butler in the wealthy household where his grandfather had once worked. In this role, he deftly turns the master against his wife, draws the young heir Allen into a seductive entanglement, and steadily removes each adversary standing in his way. When his vengeance is nearly complete, a stunning revelation surfaces: Simon is in fact the master's biological son and the legitimate heir to the family fortune. What he had not counted on was genuinely falling in love with Allen. Bound together by love and hate, the two are ultimately separated by an endless cycle of revenge, trapped in a fate they cannot break free from. The Young Master's Forbidden Butler can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-young-masters-forbidden-butler/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-young-masters-forbidden-butler/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Enemies to Lovers","Identity Twist","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87bw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-young-master-s-forbidden-butler_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87bw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-young-master-s-forbidden-butler_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d87bw/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-young-master-s-forbidden-butler_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{